  "details": "I first noticed this over a year ago already but only on my own avatar, making me think its the shader I was using, however Ive recently been noticing this on other Avatars as well.\n\nThe way the lighting changes isnt gradial but a sudden 1->0 like an on/off switch.\n\nThe example given in the pictures is my friends avatar which is on poiyomi 8.2 in the Popcorn Palace World.\n\nThe same happens in other worlds as well, like The Black Cat.\n\n1. Look at other persons Avatar.\n\n2.Rotate your headset around until their Avatar suddenly gets darker.\n\nThe picture isnt 1:1 the same as I had to look up a bit to get his avatar to suddenly go darker.\n\nThis does not happen in mirrors but only when looking directly at peoples or your own avatar. And only seems to happen in VR mode",
